79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Weatheris an important part of our daily life. Changes in temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed and other atmospheric conditions affect people in many ways. Weather information is useful for planning travel, agriculture, outdoor activities, transportation and other daily activities. With the development of Artificial Intelligence, computer systems can be used to process weather-related information and provide useful results. AI Weather Wise is an Artificial Intelligence-based project developed to provide weather- related information in a simple and understandable manner. The project demonstrates how AI and programming can be applied to a real-world problem. The system processes the available weather information and produces a suitable result based on the implemented program. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
80 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (The project was developed as part of the NM project activity. The given program was used for the implementation, and the working of the application was demonstrated successfully. Through this project, the basic concepts of Artificial Intelligence, data processing and weather analysis can be understood. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (The main idea of AI Weather Wise is to make weather information easier to process and understand. Instead of depending completely on manual analysis, the application uses computer-based processing to provide the required result. This makes the project a useful example of applying modern technology to environmental information. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
82 0 obj
<<
