>>
endobj
83 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (AI Weather Wise is a simple weather-based Artificial Intelligence project. The main purpose of the project is to process weather information and provide a meaningful output to the user. Weather data can contain different values such as temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed and atmospheric conditions. These values can be analyzed by a computer program to identify the corresponding weather condition. The project follows a basic flow in which weather-related information is provided as input. The program processes the information using the logic implemented in the application. After processing, the system generates the required weather-related output. The result is then displayed to the user through the application interface. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
