/E (AI Weather Wise provides a basic implementation of an AI-based weather application, but weather prediction is a complex task. Weather conditions depend on many environmental factors, and a simple system may not be able to consider all of them. The quality of the result also depends on the quality of the available weather information. If the data is incomplete or outdated, the result may not represent actual current conditions. A basic implementation may also have limited prediction capabilities compared with professional meteorological systems. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
